SUMMARY:Sunday Ride Folks! Weather says to reschedule !
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\n**MEETUP POINT: Burlington Go
  Station**\n1\\. Link to buy your go pass: which needs to be purchased in 
 advance\\. Be sure to be at Burlington Station by 10:30am\\.\nhttps://gotr
 ansit.com/en/tickets/cart/checkout?action=buynow\n2.Link to route we will 
 be taking:\nhttps://ridewithgps.com/routes/56242023. No mountain bikes ple
 ase and lunch will be along the way\, not in niagara falls.\n\nJoin us for
  an all day bike riding event from Burlington Go to Niagara Falls and back
 . Total length of ride is 100km\, so obviously this is not a beginner ride
 .\nPlease ensure you are bike ready so take your bike out and start practi
 cing in the spring to get yourself in good shape for this ride! I will pos
 t some practice rides starting in May and June\nNo commuter bikes please.\
 nYou will catch the go train nearest you which is $10. and take it to the 
 Burlington Go station which we will all meet -time to be confirmed\, and b
 egin our ride from there.\nLunch will be in Niagara Falls. Ensure you brin
 g power snacks and water with lots of electrolytes!\n[https://ridewithgps.
 com/routes/53737914](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/53737914)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/these-boots-are-made-for-hiking/event
 s/312916088/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260116T175906Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260116T175906Z
