END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: These Boots Are Made for Hiking
UID:event_316002685@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260808T022712Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260816T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260816T120000
SUMMARY:Kayak on the Humber River & Social!
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\nMeetup Location: 9 Old Mill R
 d\, M8X 0A5\, Down the "Discovery Walks Rd." in Kings Mill Park.\n\nArrive
  at 10:00am and prepare to be ready to hit the water for 10:30!am.\nYou do
 n't need a kayak or canoe. There are two hour rentals at the Humber River 
 Paddling Centre\, Call early to book a spot\n-**416 - 536-2067 or book mon
  -line here - https://torontoadventures.ca/**\n\nThe ultimate escape down 
 the calm meandering waters of the scenic Humber River. Whether you are pad
 dling solo on a SUP \, loading up a canoe\, or kayaking keep your eyes pee
 led for beavers\, blue herons and deer!\nLeave the city behind without eve
 r leaving Toronto!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/these-boots-are-made-for-hiking/event
 s/316002685/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260806T123157Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260806T123157Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
